 ## Research Delta
 
-Recent work suggests one coherent pivot.
+The new source sweep changes four parts of the design.
 
-- CEDAR represents persistent action constraints as deterministic automata. This gives Carnot a
-  stable object to compose, execute, and audit.
-- xTRUCE separates hard feasibility, binding operator rules, and relaxable targets. This gives
-  Carnot a safe priority order and conflict certificates.
-- PLVR learns inspectable typed programs outside model weights. This gives Carnot a Tier-2
-  self-learning target that can reuse the audited transaction store.
-- Constraint-weakening results require typed prerequisite, authority, fallback, and consequence
-  fields. A prose handoff is not enough.
-- Verifier-induced support reshaping requires a future-support gate. A current win that destroys
-  later reachable success must roll back.
+- Selective Value-Filtered Decoding makes false intervention a first-class metric. The arbiter must
+  preserve safe proposals as well as reject unsafe ones.
+- RCML separates current correction pressure from finite-gain memory. The route learner will compare
+  residual-pressure updates with raw violation accumulation. Stale pressure must decay after
+  feasibility returns.
+- AdaMEM uses transient stepwise strategy state. The live ARC branch will compare static
+  episode-start guidance with stepwise read-only strategy retrieval. It will not persist writes
+  during the active episode.
+- VerMem combines local transition checks with global memory checks. Carnot will expose a small
+  typed memory-operation set. Exact local receipts control commits. A fresh-process global audit
+  checks terminal coherence, rollback, retention, and poison behavior.
 
-V594 therefore retires the real-output fixed-point repair branch. It does not tune another text
-score. It moves exact constraints to the structured action boundary, learns only an external typed
-route program, and then tests the same contract on the live ARC path.
+These ideas extend the V594 pivot. They do not reopen learned text-energy repair. They keep the
+frozen GGUF models as generators and keep exact validators as release authorities.
 
